  "notes": "Splits AO3 tag-like text into four independent editable groups: Warnings, Categories, Relationships, and Additional Tags. Results/Browse shows each on its own tag line, and Inside-a-Fic metadata renders those values as tag links too. The first mock work uses The Midnight Visitor with Thomas Thorn/Oisín. Each group has separate font/color/size/glow settings and its own Gradient Studio target, existing Tags settings migrate forward as Additional Tags, and the final preview decorator is guarded so its metadata conversion cannot retrigger itself in a mutation loop."
